":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ケーキは全部好きなんぢゃけど、どっちかって言えばチョコケーキ派かなー。\nひめたんチョコが大好きなんよ(。・ω・。)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんの髪巻いてるときが可愛すぎるんですけどどうしてですか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まず可愛いくないけれどもっ!!!\n巻き巻きパワーのおかげかなー。\nうつり方？光の加減？\nとにかく可愛いくないけれども('`)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたんはSPL∞ASHのメンバーとまだ会ったりしたりしてるの?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アクター行っとらんけーさすがに会えんけど、たまに連絡とったりはしてますよ♪\n学校の話とか、夜にみた夢の話とか、お泊まりする約束したりとか。\nまた会いたいなー(o>ω<o)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ひめたそ・ちはるん・べびまり"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/himeka.nakamoto/img/blog/photos/images/2012/01/21/himetan0062.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなかわいいしょー♪ほんまにほんまにみんな大好き(*^^*)/\"\n「変顔しよーっ!!!」って写真撮ったら\nいい感じにぼやけてくれました。わら\nひめたんのカメラは空気読めるんです('ω`)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"※注）ちはるん（斎藤ちはるcha